### Ejecuta authLogin una vez en este archivo para obtener un token sin copiarlo.
@accessToken = {{authLogin.response.body.$.access_token}}

# @name authLogin
POST {{apiUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{authUsername}}",
  "password": "{{authPassword}}"
}

### Crear vehiculo valido (con company y vehicle_type)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/vehiculos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Toyota Fortuner",
  "description": "SUV de alta gama",
  "company_id": 1,
  "vehicle_type_id": 1,
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Crear vehiculo sin vehicle_type_id (es opcional)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/vehiculos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Chevrolet Spark",
  "company_id": 1,
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Crear vehiculo sin company_id (400 - obligatorio)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/vehiculos HTTP/1.1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sin empresa",
  "status": "active"
}
